      en: ["The mosque was built in the 17th century by Sultan Ibrahim Iskandar I.", "It features some of the most intricate coral stone carvings in the country.", "Its name originates from its use for prayers during the Eid festivals.", "The site is located in the western part of Malé island.", "The construction uses precisely fitted coral blocks without the use of mortar.", "It is considered a prime example of the Maldivian architectural style."],
