      en: ["Located on the island of Vashafaru in Haa Alif Atoll.", "Comprises ancient coral stone foundations and wall remains.", "Vashafaru is traditionally famous for building 'dhoni' boats.", "The ruins suggest a pre-Islamic or early Islamic settlement.", "Historical ceramic finds have been documented in the vicinity.", "The island is geographically located near the Ihavandhippolhu Atoll."],
      es: ["Asentamiento del siglo XI.", "Superficie: 3 hectáreas.", "Altura de la plataforma hasta 1 metro.", "¿Hallazgos de cerámica de la dinastía Ming (s. XIV)?", "Distancia a la costa: 150 metros.", "Excavaciones realizadas: 2 campañas."],
      pt: ["Assentamento do século XI.", "Área: 3 hectares.", "Altura da plataforma até 1 metro.", "Achados de cerâmica da dinastia Ming (séc. XIV)?", "Distância da costa: 150 metros.", "Escavações realizadas: 2 campanhas."],
      fr: ["Établissement du XIe siècle.", "Superficie : 3 hectares.", "Hauteur des plateformes jusqu'à 1 mètre.", "Découvertes de céramiques de la dynastie Ming (XIVe s.) ?", "Distance de la côte : 150 mètres.", "Fouilles effectuées : 2 campagnes."],
